message: "If you use this software or the dissertation results, please cite it as below."
title: "A Systematic Benchmark of Persistent Homology Pipelines for Classification"
abstract: >-
  A controlled factorial sweep (616 configurations across 6 dataset instances,
  4 filtrations, 7 vectorizers, 4 classifiers) measuring which pipeline stage
  dominates classification-accuracy variance, with repeated cross-validation,
  level-matched analyses, cross-library replication, and a reproducible
  factory/YAML/SQLite framework.
